3... dxe4 { Take on e4. [%cal Gd5e4] }
4. Nxe4
4... Bf5 { Develop with tempo by hitting the knight. [%cal Gf5e4] }
( 4... Nd7 { A fine move too, but watch for a trap. [%trap Smothered Mate] [%csl Rd6] }
  5. Qe2 { White sets the famous trap. [%cal Re2e7] }
  5... Ngf6??
  6. Nd6# { Smothered mate: the e7 pawn is pinned by the queen. Play 4...Bf5 instead. [%csl Re8] } )
